% expect-error: undefined
% divergence: capture-refuses-page-operators
% Scenario: page operators inside a form procedure raise undefined.
<< /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop showpage } >> execform
